    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "class_e_08_question_01",
      "hash64": "475F09BAE5D7C371",
      "text": "１　在太晶团体战中能够帮我方全体\\n　　提高攻击和特攻的声援是什么？\\n\\n・冲冲猛攻　　・上啊ＧｏＧｏ\\n・猛猛冲攻",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "class_e_08_ansewer_01a",
      "hash64": "A15E17EDE9D18A91",
