    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "class_e_08_question_05",
      "hash64": "475F0DBAE5D7CA3D",
      "text": "５　在连接对战的普通规则中\\n　　可以使用多只相同的同行宝可梦，\\n　　或让宝可梦携带相同的持有物吗？\\n\\n・可以　・不可以",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "class_e_08_ansewer_05a",
      "hash64": "A1503FEDE9C5912D",
      "text": "可以",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "class_e_08_ansewer_05b",
      "hash64": "A1503CEDE9C58C14",
